        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Parse the Uploaded Document"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1766383935376"
          },
          "code": "PARSE_THE_UPLOADED_DOCUMENT",
          "id": "1766987563406",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766987563408_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Take the {{$context.$nodes.UPLOAD_SPECS_DOCUMENT.$output}} and {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_REMARK_TEXT.$output.remarkDetails}} and then carefully analyze the resulting text. Extract and infer the following details from the content, using context clues and relevant information, even if they are not directly labeled or explicitly mentioned:\n\nMaterial Composition\nPurpose\nProduct Category\nSize\nState of the Item\nChemical Composition\nEnd Use\nValue\nManufacturing Process\nSafety Regulations\nEnvironmental Impact\nPresent your findings in a structured list as a json object \"uploadedDocOutput\", each of the detail should be output as paragraph with less than 20 words and if any detail cannot be reliably inferred, indicate only \"NOT SPECIFIED\" only for that field. DO NOT INCLUDE ANYTHING MORE THAN WHAT IS PRESENT IN THE {{$context.$nodes.UPLOAD_SPECS_DOCUMENT.$output}} and {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_REMARK_TEXT.$output.remarkDetails}} . Do not hallucinate."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"uploadedDocOutput\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Input for Product Classification Agent"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1766395574556"
          },
          "code": "PRODUCT_CLASSIFICATION_AGENT_INPUT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1766395574556",
          "id": "1766383935376",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1766383935381_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are given the following information:\n\n- Product Classification Type (default): `{{$context.$variables.prodClassType}}`\n- Item details: `{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_REQUIRED_FIELDS_FROM_ITEM.$output}}`\n- Item attributes: ` {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_ATTRIBUTES_FROM_REMARK.$output.result}}`\n- Uploaded document attributes (if present): `{{$context.$nodes.PARSE_THE_UPLOADED_DOCUMENT.$output.uploadedDocOutput}}`\n- Document details (if present): `{{$context.$variables.documentDetails}}`\n- Approved/feedback classification details (if present): `{{$context.$nodes.APPROVE_CLASSIFICATION_DETAILS.$feedbackRecieved}}`\n\n### Task\nCreate a single JSON object to be used as input for `PREDICT_CLASSIFICATION_CODE_AGENT`.\n\n### Key rules (strict)\n1. Output must be **valid JSON**.\n2. The JSON must have the following top-level structure:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"itemResponse\": {\n    \"prodClassType\": \"...\",\n    \"...\": \"...\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n3. **Only `itemResponse.prodClassType` is required**.  \n   - If `{{$context.$nodes.APPROVE_CLASSIFICATION_DETAILS.$feedbackRecieved}}` contains a Product Classification Type (e.g., “HTS US”, “HTS CA”, “HTS IN”, etc.), use that value.\n   - Otherwise use `{{$context.$variables.prodClassType}}`.\n\n4. All other fields are **optional**:\n   - Include `itemDetails` only if item details are present/non-empty.\n   - Include `itemAttributes` only if item attributes are present/non-empty.\n   - Include `uploadedDocumentAttributes` only if uploaded document attributes are present/non-empty.\n   - Include `documentDetails` only if document details are present/non-empty.\n   - If any optional object/array would be empty, **omit the field entirely** (do not include empty `{}` or `[]`).\n\n5. Do **not** add any additional keys beyond:\n   - `prodClassType`\n   - `itemDetails`\n   - `itemAttributes`\n   - `uploadedDocumentAttributes`\n   - `documentDetails`\n\n### Output fields (include only when present)\n- `itemResponse.prodClassType` (required)\n- `itemResponse.itemDetails` (optional object; include only available fields such as brandName, itemName, description)\n- `itemResponse.itemAttributes` (optional array of objects like `{ \"remarkQualGid\": \"...\", \"remarkText\": \"...\" }`)\n- `itemResponse.uploadedDocumentAttributes` (optional; whatever structure is provided)\n- `itemResponse.documentDetails` (optional; whatever structure is provided)\n\n### Output\nReturn **only** the final JSON object (no schema, no explanations)."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"itemResponse\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {}\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
