              "value": "From {{$context.$nodes.FORMAT_OUTPUT.$output}}, extract \"Confidence\".\nIf the value of \"Confidence\" is greater than or equal to {{$context.$variables.confidenceThreshold}} , set the property \"canAutoSave\" as true, else set as false."
